  <item>
    <title>来点硬的，带你看中国咖啡冲煮大赛</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62f4e861eb0492cf2f508609</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62f4e861eb0492cf2f508609</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Aug 2022 11:30:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>7月31日 2022年世界咖啡冲煮大赛中国区总决赛冠军已经诞生</span></p><span></span><p><span>来自“乔治公社”的主理人 彭近洋</span></p><span></span><p><span>恭喜🎉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjsMy9NGGF-5jv79KTe0DHm5tj0a.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>写在前面的话：</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们就邀请一位咖啡爱好者一起观看这次冠军的比赛视频，视频中有非常多即兴出来的对话，若有不妥请告诉我们，将虚心学习进行改正～ （不是故意而为之的哦）</span></p><span></span><p><span>吃喝玩乐，恰到好处！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一档由吧唧Go赞助播客，在这里你会听到关于</span></p><span></span><p><span>☕️「咖啡有关的」 来自专业咖啡师带着你一起喝咖啡，学咖啡...</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗「 探店中的吃喝玩乐」也是生活中的突发奇想...</span></p><span></span><p><span>📍坐标成都，如果你也想和我们一起探店，那就加个微信交个朋友吧～</span></p><span></span><p><span>👬和小恰一起去寻找有趣的店！</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别感谢：</span></p><span></span><p><span>⚠️：封面图片来自《上海国际咖啡文化节》</span></p><span></span><p><span>⚠️：本期视频的链接🔗 来自 B站账号【咖啡沙龙】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Aa411f7SS?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Aa411f7SS?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>赛事介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">1:15</a>介绍世界咖啡大赛介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">3:18</a>观看比赛前的介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">4:15</a>开始观看（收听质量不是很清晰，感兴趣的听众可以戳上面的视频链接）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">4:48</a>关于比赛主题（以下图片信息）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj2LMuSSPEQUlsFJk7YulcDxmbuG.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">7:30</a>比赛豆信息</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FknVSuLGANBlQclcKaoBdLRk1dLg.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">9:27</a>咖啡豆烘焙信息</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg0fRTKQUIVHBYqVS9G2Ml6f1qv7.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="816">13:36</a>冲煮大赛参数</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a>咖啡风味描述1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a>咖啡风味描述2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a>咖啡风味描述3</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1923">32:03</a>咖啡饮用建议2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2092">34:52</a>咖啡饮用建议2</span></p><span></span><p><span>— 互动方式 —</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号@吧唧GO</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书@吧唧GO</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信号@navi-biajigo （回复播客）</span></p><span></span><p><span>— 对话成员—</span></p><span></span><p><span>👩🏻雯子 （2020年WBC世界咖啡师大赛中国选拔赛上海站冠军）</span></p><span></span><p><span>👦🏻Erlich （@有限理性）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🧒🏻杨老师（学生最喜欢的那款老师）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM 快乐世界 — 橙</span></p>]]></description>
